From: awto <noreply@awto.au>
Subject: [PATCH] mips: 16 KiB kernel stacks on 32-bit with 4 KiB pages

Test for sw1 stack corruption (#186): softirq RX path (bridge, nftables, flow offload) runs on the 8 KiB task stack, no IRQ stacks on MIPS32.

--- a/arch/mips/include/asm/thread_info.h
+++ b/arch/mips/include/asm/thread_info.h
@@ -78,5 +78,5 @@
 /* thread information allocation */
 #if defined(CONFIG_PAGE_SIZE_4KB) && defined(CONFIG_32BIT)
-#define THREAD_SIZE_ORDER (1)
+#define THREAD_SIZE_ORDER (2)
 #endif
 #if defined(CONFIG_PAGE_SIZE_4KB) && defined(CONFIG_64BIT)
